Practical Task Week 7


Create a simple To-Do List web application using Django that allows users to Create, Read, Update, and Delete (CRUD) tasks. This project will help you understand Django models, views, templates, and URL routing.
1. Task Model
Each task should contain:
title (short text)
description (optional text)
is_completed (boolean)
created_at (date & time)
2. Create Task
A form to add a new task
Validate that the title is required
Redirect to the task list after successful creation
3. Read Tasks
Display a list of all tasks
Show task title, status (completed / not completed), and creation date
Completed tasks should be visually distinguishable (e.g., strikethrough text)
4. Update Task
Ability to:
Edit task title and description
Mark a task as completed or incomplete
5. Delete Task
Add a delete button for each task
Show a confirmation page before deletion






